sequenceDiagram
  actor Parent
  actor Admin
  actor Guard
  participant UI as React UI
  participant API as Java services
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant Events as ReviewPublisher / Inbox
  Parent->>UI: Select student, configure relationship
  UI->>API: POST /guardian-students/
  API->>DB: Save relationship and pending request
  DB-->>UI: Pending relationship
  Admin->>UI: Approve request
  UI->>API: PATCH /verification-requests/{id}/approve
  API->>DB: Lock relationship, update request, commit
  API->>Events: afterCommit: dispatch ReviewEvent
  UI->>Events: GET /notifications (private inbox, every 3s)
  Events-->>UI: Notice triggers dashboard refresh
  Parent->>UI: Configure 5-minute QR
  UI->>API: POST /qr-codes/ (expires_in_minutes=5)
  API->>API: QrIssuePlan.Builder.build().issue(token)
  API->>DB: Save active QR
  Guard->>UI: Scan QR
  UI->>API: POST /qr-codes/verify
  API->>DB: Lock relationship and QR; mark USED; insert ALLOWED; commit
  DB-->>UI: Access result
  Guard->>UI: Repeat scan
  UI->>API: POST /qr-codes/verify
  API->>DB: Insert DENIED / QR_ALREADY_USED; commit
  Guard->>UI: Export redacted JSON report
  UI->>API: GET /reports/access/export?format=json&redact=true
  API->>DB: Read access logs and linked records
  API->>API: Adapter -> Decorator -> Factory Method -> document
  API-->>UI: Download access-report.json
